obs the cold run harness and the Monitor tool disagree about how long a hold may run unattended -- the harness runs for roughly 65-70 minutes and the Monitor caps each arming at 10 minutes regardless of the requested timeout, so a long hold costs several re-arm turns; this is a tool-interaction fact worth knowing for the next lap rather than a red to book
